{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man named <strong>Denys</strong> moves into a cheap apartment after landing a new job. At first, everything seems normal \u2014 but soon he realizes that something is very wrong. Strange things begin to happen not only in his apartment, but throughout the building.<br>Denis finds himself entangled in a web of <strong>paranormal events</strong> \u2014 and now, he must uncover the truth and find a way to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936350/extras/38c3fa7072e721b2e14a74ce2ba331cf.webp?t=1769763216\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936350/extras/38c3fa7072e721b2e14a74ce2ba331cf.poster.avif?t=1769763216\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=270 /></picture></span><br><strong>Faint Echo</strong> is a psychological horror visual novel with point-and-click elements.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting story about <strong>paranormal mystery and survival</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of the house and the truth behind the cursed apartment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed environments and search for clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a dark, <strong>oppressive atmosphere</strong> that will keep you on edge<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936350/extras/a6be69a19d32ba2e26cd93201a1ec049.poster.avif?t=1769763216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936350/extras/a6be69a19d32ba2e26cd93201a1ec049.webm?t=1769763216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3